## 🚀 Quick Start Commands

```javascript
// Load current save data
loadGameData()

// Save game progress
saveGameData(data)

// Reset game (admin)
adminResetGame()

// Unlock specific day (admin)
adminUnlockDay('wells', 5)

// Check save data
checkSaveData()
```

**Remember**: This is an educational game for young children. Every decision should prioritize their learning, engagement, and positive experience while maintaining the magical adventure atmosphere.